WEBVTT

01:40.539 --> 01:44.180
[A Moment But Forever]

01:45.060 --> 01:47.200
[Episode 22]

01:48.150 --> 01:49.479
You've come at just the right time.

01:49.870 --> 01:50.789
The Immortal Dance

01:50.789 --> 01:52.070
is about to begin.

01:52.070 --> 01:53.310
There are still some good seats available.

01:53.310 --> 01:54.759
Let me take you to have a look.

01:58.479 --> 01:59.310
Thank you.

02:01.480 --> 02:03.280
You two aren't from Yandu, are you?

02:03.790 --> 02:04.920
Don't blink later.

02:04.950 --> 02:06.040
This Immortal Dance

02:06.040 --> 02:07.710
is unique to Yandu.

02:07.950 --> 02:09.120
Countless scholars and refined guests

02:09.120 --> 02:10.750
come here just to witness its beauty.

02:10.750 --> 02:12.080
How is it unique?

02:12.710 --> 02:13.520
Miss,

02:13.560 --> 02:15.710
why do I feel like you look familiar?

02:20.150 --> 02:21.240
You must have mistaken me for someone else.

02:21.800 --> 02:23.430
You just said this dance is unique.

02:23.670 --> 02:24.760
What exactly makes it unique?

02:25.520 --> 02:27.680
This dance isn't performed by humans.

02:27.800 --> 02:29.030
Not performed by humans?

02:29.310 --> 02:30.190
Then by what?

02:30.310 --> 02:31.190
The Immortal Dance is,

02:31.210 --> 02:33.250
of course, danced by immortals.

02:36.910 --> 02:37.870
Please enjoy.

02:40.079 --> 02:41.750
You think Xiu would like this place?

02:42.310 --> 02:43.150
Let me look around.

02:48.470 --> 02:49.280
Xiu.

02:50.590 --> 02:51.400
Xiu?

02:53.680 --> 02:54.470
Xiu.

02:56.190 --> 02:57.000
Xiu.

05:17.560 --> 05:20.000
Bravo! Bravo!

05:21.720 --> 05:22.510
Bravo!

05:28.480 --> 05:29.270
Goddess?

05:30.240 --> 05:31.510
She's the Goddess.

05:32.880 --> 05:34.590
Everyone, look, the Goddess.

05:38.190 --> 05:40.220
It really is the Goddess.

05:41.830 --> 05:42.680
Look at her.

05:44.030 --> 05:45.659
Goddess.

05:46.159 --> 05:46.950
Goddess?

05:47.310 --> 05:48.680
Don't go, Goddess.

05:49.120 --> 05:50.680
How could you let her leave?

05:50.680 --> 05:51.750
Slow down!

05:52.510 --> 05:53.190
That dancer

05:53.190 --> 05:54.430
in the painting did look like me.

05:54.630 --> 05:55.920
Maybe someone saw me before

05:55.920 --> 05:57.159
and painted me.

05:57.310 --> 05:58.270
But I really don't know

05:58.270 --> 05:59.270
what's going on.

05:59.750 --> 06:00.560
Yuanzhong!

06:15.630 --> 06:17.070
What are you looking at?

06:39.620 --> 06:40.909
♫Listening♫

06:40.930 --> 06:44.430
♫Toona leaves knock fireflies into a vase♫

06:44.460 --> 06:47.420
♫Ripples faintly spreading♫

06:48.320 --> 06:49.680
♫In the pavilion in the clouds♫

06:49.710 --> 06:51.670
♫Warm wine brews to the sound of the zither♫

06:51.870 --> 06:56.330
♫The fragrance lingers like brush strokes, sketching out your form♫

06:52.600 --> 06:54.040
When I was young, I saw someone

06:56.680 --> 06:57.830
who looked very much like you.

06:57.060 --> 06:58.220
♫Tonight♫

06:58.380 --> 07:02.240
♫In a light intoxication, I feel the longing in the crystalline snow♫

07:01.310 --> 07:02.680
Was it at the Pinghu battlefield?

07:02.260 --> 07:05.110
♫I cannot bear to think of you♫

07:03.390 --> 07:04.310
As you know, I...

07:04.310 --> 07:04.950
No.

07:05.500 --> 07:07.140
♫I only wish♫

07:06.360 --> 07:07.240
It was even earlier than that.

07:07.160 --> 07:08.990
♫That the years would remain ever sunny♫

07:09.400 --> 07:13.570
♫So that, within the drifting light, I could share the breeze with you♫

07:10.390 --> 07:11.950
It's just that it has been so long

07:14.040 --> 07:14.800
that I've forgotten

07:14.180 --> 07:15.150
♫The wind blows♫

07:14.800 --> 07:15.830
what she looked like.

07:15.170 --> 07:16.570
♫It stirs the scenery♫

07:16.780 --> 07:18.320
♫It awakens our heart♫

07:18.240 --> 07:20.360
Who was it?

07:18.350 --> 07:21.990
♫It makes me certain that you are my destiny♫

07:21.630 --> 07:22.430
Who was it?

07:22.620 --> 07:23.860
♫The closer we get♫

07:23.890 --> 07:25.490
♫The more it feels like a dream♫

07:25.510 --> 07:26.880
♫And the more I look intoxicated♫

07:26.910 --> 07:31.230
♫I cannot fully express my yearning for you♫

07:27.240 --> 07:28.600
I actually don't know either.

07:31.360 --> 07:32.360
♫The wind blows♫

07:32.380 --> 07:34.140
♫It blows away the shadows of the clouds♫

07:34.190 --> 07:35.840
♫It makes the moon seem even brighter♫

07:35.860 --> 07:40.040
♫It makes me wake up from a dream♫

07:40.060 --> 07:41.290
♫The wind blows♫

07:41.320 --> 07:42.909
♫It reddens my eyes♫

07:42.940 --> 07:44.940
♫It warms the promise we made♫

07:45.050 --> 07:48.570
♫In the wind, we gently♫

07:48.600 --> 07:51.280
♫Drift into a better place♫

07:53.570 --> 07:54.450
♫The wind blows♫

07:54.470 --> 07:55.909
♫It blows away the shadows of the clouds♫

07:55.940 --> 07:57.580
♫It makes the moon seem even brighter♫

07:57.600 --> 08:01.930
♫It makes me wake up from a dream♫

08:01.980 --> 08:03.340
♫The wind blows♫

08:03.360 --> 08:04.670
♫It reddens my eyes♫

08:04.690 --> 08:06.690
♫It warms the promise we made♫

08:06.710 --> 08:10.490
♫In the wind, we gently♫

08:10.530 --> 08:13.790
♫Drift into a better place♫

08:20.600 --> 08:21.720
It's so quiet here.

08:21.830 --> 08:23.190
Would Xiu be here?

08:28.950 --> 08:30.120
He should be here.

08:30.140 --> 08:31.460
The Divine Hand has already sensed it.

08:32.200 --> 08:33.350
I'll try to wake him up.

08:33.370 --> 08:34.679
Is there anything I can do?

08:34.789 --> 08:35.480
No.

08:49.870 --> 08:50.670
Xiu.

08:51.720 --> 08:52.510
Xiu?

08:53.910 --> 08:54.720
Xiu.

08:55.960 --> 08:56.750
Xiu!

09:04.350 --> 09:05.040
Dad,

09:05.070 --> 09:07.150
why are we worshiping a firecracker?

09:07.820 --> 09:09.860
Don't talk nonsense. This is the Fire God.

09:10.440 --> 09:11.510
Disrespecting the gods

09:11.510 --> 09:12.550
will get you slapped.

09:12.550 --> 09:13.240
But this is clearly

09:13.240 --> 09:14.840
just a big firecracker.

09:14.910 --> 09:16.030
You don't understand.

09:16.480 --> 09:17.870
This is our family's guardian deity.

09:18.270 --> 09:20.390
It's the Fire God's manifested form.

09:20.570 --> 09:21.600
This was passed down from your

09:21.620 --> 09:22.550
grandfather's grandfather.

09:22.870 --> 09:23.870
As long as it's here,

09:24.080 --> 09:25.150
our family's fireworks shop

09:25.240 --> 09:26.270
will be safe and sound,

09:26.270 --> 09:27.270
with no disasters or misfortune.

09:27.270 --> 09:28.240
Really?

09:29.000 --> 09:29.750
Stop talking so much.

09:29.750 --> 09:30.630
Just worship it.

09:30.720 --> 09:31.840
If it weren't for the god's protection,

09:31.870 --> 09:33.440
who could have made such a big firecracker?

09:51.910 --> 09:52.720
Xiu,

09:53.440 --> 09:54.240
go back to your position.

09:56.440 --> 09:57.240
Xiu,

09:57.840 --> 09:58.630
go back to your position.

09:58.960 --> 10:00.360
Who is it? Who is speaking?

10:00.360 --> 10:01.440
Dad, Dad,

10:01.440 --> 10:03.480
the Fire God seems to be about to explode!

10:03.670 --> 10:04.480
What?

10:04.520 --> 10:05.840
Dad, what should we do?

10:08.470 --> 10:10.750
The Fire God is going to explode! It's going to explode!

10:51.030 --> 10:51.910
You're right.

10:51.910 --> 10:53.510
Xiu indeed likes lively scenes.

11:18.720 --> 11:19.840
-Xiu, stop crying.
-Xiu.

11:19.840 --> 11:20.670
Shut your mouth

11:20.670 --> 11:21.480
right now.

11:26.030 --> 11:27.320
Why does he keep crying?

11:28.120 --> 11:29.320
Are you hungry?

11:31.080 --> 11:32.320
Come on, think of a solution.

11:32.340 --> 11:33.700
What can I do?

11:33.960 --> 11:35.360
Isn't he your weapon spirit?

11:35.360 --> 11:36.720
Don't you know the reason?

11:36.720 --> 11:37.510
Well...

11:37.790 --> 11:39.440
He wasn't like this the last time I saw him.

11:39.790 --> 11:41.150
What was he like then?

11:41.510 --> 11:43.150
He… he wasn't a baby.

11:43.200 --> 11:44.320
At most, he was a child

11:44.320 --> 11:45.600
and he was growing rapidly.

11:46.150 --> 11:47.030
Do you remember

11:47.030 --> 11:48.030
what he ate

11:48.030 --> 11:48.910
to grow up?

11:51.890 --> 11:52.870
At that time on Fangwai Mountain,

11:52.870 --> 11:54.270
Zi Fei and Kai Shan were taking care of him,

11:54.270 --> 11:55.390
so I didn't pay much attention.

12:00.840 --> 12:02.200
Just think of a solution now.

12:02.200 --> 12:04.000
He can't keep crying like this.

12:05.700 --> 12:06.820
How about feeding him some wine

12:07.120 --> 12:07.840
and getting him drunk?

12:07.840 --> 12:08.480
He...

12:08.830 --> 12:10.200
He's still a child.

12:10.440 --> 12:12.410
He's a weapon spirit, not a child.

12:13.240 --> 12:13.910
Xiu,

12:13.910 --> 12:15.390
I know you can understand what I'm saying.

12:15.390 --> 12:16.720
Shut up

12:16.720 --> 12:17.360
right now,

12:17.360 --> 12:18.030
or I'll stuff you back

12:18.030 --> 12:19.240
into the firecracker.

12:21.000 --> 12:21.790
There, there, there.

12:21.790 --> 12:23.550
There, there.

12:23.790 --> 12:24.910
Xiu, stop crying.

12:25.870 --> 12:26.790
Stop crying. Stop crying.

12:26.790 --> 12:27.960
Xiu, stop crying.

12:28.910 --> 12:30.150
Stop crying. Stop crying.

12:30.270 --> 12:31.720
Stop crying. Stop crying, Xiu.

12:31.870 --> 12:32.960
There, there.

12:32.960 --> 12:33.790
Stop crying, okay?

12:33.790 --> 12:35.550
Stop crying. Stop crying.

12:35.550 --> 12:36.510
There, there.

12:36.510 --> 12:37.440
Stop crying, okay?

12:37.440 --> 12:38.200
There, there.

12:38.320 --> 12:39.120
Yuanzhong.

12:40.030 --> 12:40.840
Yuanzhong!

12:41.440 --> 12:42.480
You try it.

12:46.480 --> 12:47.240
There, there.

12:47.240 --> 12:48.510
Stop crying,

12:49.440 --> 12:50.480
Xiu.

12:51.390 --> 12:53.150
Stop crying. Stop crying.

12:55.080 --> 12:58.350
It's 1 AM, and the world is peaceful and safe!

13:01.270 --> 13:05.250
It's 1 AM, and the world is peaceful and safe!

13:11.480 --> 13:12.270
Yuanzhong.

13:13.120 --> 13:14.360
Yuanzhong, wake up!

13:15.240 --> 13:16.360
Look at Xiu!

13:16.480 --> 13:17.510
I can't handle him.

13:17.790 --> 13:18.870
He's grown up.

13:21.920 --> 13:22.730
Where is he?

13:28.150 --> 13:29.390
X-Xiu.

13:29.570 --> 13:30.380
Look.

13:37.090 --> 13:37.900
The hairpin?

13:44.840 --> 13:45.840
I remember now.

13:46.080 --> 13:47.200
What do you remember?

13:47.200 --> 13:48.630
Xiu doesn't eat ordinary food.

13:48.910 --> 13:50.100
He needs to eat gold to grow up.

13:50.190 --> 13:51.120
Eat gold?

13:51.150 --> 13:51.860
Yes.

13:52.440 --> 13:53.360
Xiu is of the fire element.

13:53.440 --> 13:54.480
He feeds on gold.

13:54.530 --> 13:55.480
Back then, on Fangwai Mountain,

13:55.480 --> 13:56.790
Zi Fei and the others must have fed him

13:56.790 --> 13:57.720
a lot of gold

13:57.740 --> 13:59.110
to make him grow up in one day.

13:59.840 --> 14:01.320
Feeding on gold?

14:01.630 --> 14:02.330
But...

14:02.710 --> 14:04.790
But we don't have any gold.

14:07.870 --> 14:09.480
Xiu, Xiu.

14:10.960 --> 14:12.440
I know you can understand me.

14:12.850 --> 14:13.690
Let me tell you,

14:13.840 --> 14:15.150
things are different now.

14:15.510 --> 14:16.910
If you want to stay by my side,

14:16.930 --> 14:18.330
you'll have to earn your own food.

14:18.360 --> 14:19.150
Don't count on me.

14:19.240 --> 14:20.030
Did you hear that?

14:30.500 --> 14:31.790
-Yuanzhong.
-How dare you.

14:31.790 --> 14:32.550
Yuanzhong!

14:33.910 --> 14:34.750
He's still a kid.

14:35.240 --> 14:36.840
He can't earn his own food yet.

14:37.240 --> 14:38.600
Don't be so harsh on him.

14:38.600 --> 14:39.440
He's young?

14:40.390 --> 14:41.510
The number of people he killed on the Pinghu battlefield

14:41.510 --> 14:42.320
was no less than mine.

14:42.320 --> 14:44.080
That was on a battlefield. It was different.

14:44.360 --> 14:45.910
He's just a child now.

14:47.600 --> 14:48.630
Right, Xiu?

14:50.150 --> 14:51.000
See?

14:51.120 --> 14:52.440
If you rely on your master,

14:52.470 --> 14:53.300
you'll probably starve

14:53.330 --> 14:54.420
before you even grew up.

14:56.720 --> 14:57.670
Alright, never mind.

14:57.670 --> 14:58.320
I'll figure out a way

14:58.320 --> 14:59.440
to earn food for him.

15:03.600 --> 15:06.490
[Qiju Pavilion]

15:18.910 --> 15:19.720
Mr. Xu,

15:20.080 --> 15:21.080
if there's anything else that needs repairing,

15:21.080 --> 15:22.360
bring it out for me.

15:22.720 --> 15:23.670
There's nothing

15:23.670 --> 15:24.750
I can't fix.

15:24.750 --> 15:25.550
Alright, alright.

15:25.750 --> 15:27.080
Yi, go and get everything

15:27.080 --> 15:28.600
that needs repairing here.

15:29.030 --> 15:29.840
Yes.

15:42.390 --> 15:43.200
Don't touch it.

15:50.670 --> 15:52.630
Mr. Xu, they're all fixed now.

15:54.150 --> 15:55.840
Yi, go get the silver.

15:56.720 --> 15:57.510
Wait a moment.

15:58.670 --> 15:59.480
Miss Ji,

16:00.240 --> 16:02.550
business requires honesty.

16:02.870 --> 16:03.720
We agreed that

16:03.720 --> 16:05.080
if you fix these things,

16:05.080 --> 16:06.510
I'd give you 10 taels of silver.

16:06.750 --> 16:08.550
You can't go back on your word.

16:09.480 --> 16:10.630
What I mean is,

16:10.840 --> 16:11.770
could you

16:11.790 --> 16:12.960
exchange this silver

16:12.960 --> 16:14.080
for gold beans?

16:19.630 --> 16:20.440
Thank you.

16:21.270 --> 16:22.080
Here.

16:22.870 --> 16:23.840
Eat slowly.

16:28.670 --> 16:29.550
They are all gone already?

16:33.720 --> 16:34.480
Looks like raising a child

16:34.480 --> 16:35.750
really is expensive.

16:37.320 --> 16:38.080
How about

16:38.080 --> 16:39.390
we go find Zi Fei?

16:39.510 --> 16:40.440
The journey is long,

16:40.600 --> 16:41.510
and the travel expenses

16:41.510 --> 16:42.750
would cost money too.

16:42.750 --> 16:44.320
But with how much Xiu eats,

16:44.360 --> 16:45.630
even if we work ourselves to the bone,

16:45.630 --> 16:47.200
we still won't earn enough gold.

16:50.980 --> 16:51.790
Hey,

16:51.960 --> 16:52.720
why didn't you bring any money

16:52.720 --> 16:53.750
when you came out?

16:54.240 --> 16:55.360
You didn't bring any either.

16:56.080 --> 16:57.600
But I'm your handmaiden.

17:09.920 --> 17:12.270
Bravo!

17:30.440 --> 17:31.240
If we really can't figure out a way,

17:31.350 --> 17:32.510
let's just let Xiu go hungry.

17:32.640 --> 17:34.060
He's a weapon spirit. He won't starve to death.

17:34.240 --> 17:35.270
How can we do that?

17:35.310 --> 17:36.880
That way, he won't be able to grow up.

17:37.350 --> 17:38.270
Then what do you suggest?

17:40.000 --> 17:40.790
How about...

17:41.510 --> 17:42.310
How about you

17:42.310 --> 17:43.350
seal him away for now

17:43.550 --> 17:45.160
and unseal him when Zi Fei and the others arrive?

17:47.240 --> 17:48.110
Impressive.

17:48.440 --> 17:49.640
You actually came up with that idea.

17:49.640 --> 17:50.240
I'm starting to doubt

17:50.240 --> 17:51.640
your identity as the Mute Lady of Wu Mountain.

17:53.070 --> 17:54.200
Then what do you suggest we do?

17:59.440 --> 18:00.240
Xiu?

18:00.920 --> 18:01.720
Xiu!

18:02.750 --> 18:03.790
Xiu is gone.

18:11.790 --> 18:13.480
Where did this child come from?

18:16.790 --> 18:17.680
What's going on?

18:17.680 --> 18:18.830
Where did this child come from?

18:21.030 --> 18:23.000
Where did this child come from?

18:23.000 --> 18:24.400
My bracelet was stolen!

18:24.790 --> 18:25.590
Let me take a look.

18:33.920 --> 18:34.680
Excuse me,

18:34.790 --> 18:35.920
have you seen a boy,

18:35.920 --> 18:36.680
about 4 or 5 years old,

18:36.680 --> 18:37.880
wearing red clothes?

18:38.160 --> 18:39.920
Waiter, bring us the wine!

18:40.450 --> 18:41.260
Coming!

18:41.400 --> 18:42.590
Sorry, there are a lot of people here.

18:42.590 --> 18:43.750
I honestly didn't notice.

18:43.750 --> 18:45.310
Please look for him yourself.

18:47.240 --> 18:48.750
Do you think he might be here?

18:49.750 --> 18:50.650
Let's split up and look for him.

18:56.680 --> 18:57.750
What are you dawdling for?

18:57.750 --> 18:58.720
You're about to go on stage.

18:58.720 --> 18:59.920
Be quick.

18:59.960 --> 19:00.880
I'll be ready soon.

19:01.110 --> 19:01.960
I just need to wear a hairpin.

19:01.960 --> 19:02.640
Hurry up.

19:05.680 --> 19:06.510
Where did it go?

19:07.000 --> 19:08.590
It was here just now.

19:09.070 --> 19:10.030
Which hairpin?

19:10.160 --> 19:11.240
The one from Mr. Dong,

19:11.240 --> 19:12.200
the gold one.

19:12.920 --> 19:14.160
It should be in the jewelry box.

19:19.120 --> 19:21.030
My earrings and necklaces

19:21.030 --> 19:22.000
are also missing.

19:22.790 --> 19:23.830
What's going on?

19:39.070 --> 19:40.510
Whose child is this?

19:42.640 --> 19:43.980
Whose child is this?

19:45.240 --> 19:46.030
All mine are gone.

19:46.030 --> 19:47.060
Whose child is this?

19:47.080 --> 19:48.520
Whose child is stealing?

19:48.550 --> 19:49.110
Exactly.

19:49.110 --> 19:50.320
Such a young kid,

19:50.350 --> 19:51.440
and his parents don't even supervise him.

19:53.540 --> 19:54.670
Xiu, come out.

19:56.400 --> 19:57.200
You...

19:59.340 --> 20:00.550
-He ran away!
-Xiu!

20:00.750 --> 20:01.550
He stole things!

20:08.790 --> 20:09.590
Xiu.

20:14.110 --> 20:14.920
Xiu.

20:15.400 --> 20:16.550
Where did this child come from?

20:20.590 --> 20:21.400
Xiu.

20:22.450 --> 20:23.250
Xiu?

20:24.880 --> 20:25.790
-Stop running.
-Xiu!

20:27.880 --> 20:28.640
Let's see if you dare run again.

20:28.640 --> 20:29.920
I told you not to run around.

20:32.070 --> 20:33.240
Xiu, give it to me now.

20:40.750 --> 20:41.790
Stop them!

20:41.970 --> 20:42.780
Stop him!

20:42.950 --> 20:43.750
It's him!

20:44.020 --> 20:45.350
Pay up! Pay up!

20:45.400 --> 20:46.310
You thief!

20:46.350 --> 20:47.160
Pay up!

20:58.440 --> 20:59.400
Xiu is asleep?

21:01.590 --> 21:02.920
He's sleeping like a pig.

21:07.830 --> 21:09.160
We were lucky today that Mr. Xu

21:09.160 --> 21:10.310
was willing to lend us money.

21:10.480 --> 21:11.200
Otherwise,

21:11.200 --> 21:12.880
it wouldn't have been so easy to get away.

21:19.350 --> 21:20.680
He's sleeping so soundly.

21:21.680 --> 21:22.510
He's full,

21:22.720 --> 21:23.830
so of course he's sleeping soundly.

21:25.350 --> 21:27.070
When you said you thought he was a hassle earlier,

21:27.200 --> 21:28.680
I thought you were joking.

21:28.720 --> 21:29.510
Now,

21:29.750 --> 21:31.200
I've really experienced it.

21:35.960 --> 21:37.920
Raising a child really isn't easy.

21:38.440 --> 21:39.680
He's not a child.

21:40.590 --> 21:42.350
But he looks like one.

21:42.720 --> 21:44.110
Look at him now.

21:44.550 --> 21:46.000
He looks about 3 or 4 years old.

21:46.510 --> 21:47.310
But...

21:47.470 --> 21:49.230
why can't he speak yet?

21:52.640 --> 21:54.110
What did he look like when he grew up?

21:54.880 --> 21:55.680
Just like that.

21:56.350 --> 21:57.160
Was he well-behaved?

21:57.750 --> 21:58.550
He was fine.

22:01.920 --> 22:03.350
I've never seen

22:03.350 --> 22:03.960
a weapon spirit

22:03.960 --> 22:05.400
that can grow up like him.

22:07.790 --> 22:09.030
Have you seen many weapon spirits?

22:09.640 --> 22:10.680
A few, I suppose.

22:11.330 --> 22:13.160
It is said that the Mute Lady of Wu Mountain is skilled in crafting.

22:13.560 --> 22:14.400
Have you ever created

22:14.430 --> 22:16.030
a divine artifact that can produce weapon spirits?

22:16.030 --> 22:16.790
Of course.

22:17.070 --> 22:17.920
What kind?

22:18.240 --> 22:19.400
A lot.

22:20.640 --> 22:21.720
Nonsense.

22:21.920 --> 22:23.000
If you were really that capable,

22:23.000 --> 22:24.720
you'd be the God of Craft.

22:30.070 --> 22:30.880
Do you

22:30.880 --> 22:32.240
have anything else to do now?

22:33.440 --> 22:34.240
Why?

22:34.400 --> 22:35.200
Come with me.

22:38.240 --> 22:39.030
What?

22:43.200 --> 22:43.830
You haven't

22:43.830 --> 22:45.110
eaten anything all day.

22:45.510 --> 22:46.440
Are you hungry?

22:49.110 --> 22:50.160
When did you buy these?

22:50.160 --> 22:51.160
Just now.

22:51.240 --> 22:52.350
The owner of the noodle shop, Mr. Zhao,

22:52.350 --> 22:54.160
said this shop makes very good dim sum,

22:54.240 --> 22:55.270
so I bought some for you

22:55.270 --> 22:56.350
to try.

23:04.480 --> 23:05.310
Is it good?

23:12.110 --> 23:12.920
Yuanzhong,

23:13.960 --> 23:15.400
don't worry.

23:15.750 --> 23:17.110
Mr. Xu from Qiju Pavilion

23:17.110 --> 23:17.790
wants to hire me

23:17.790 --> 23:19.110
as a craftsman there.

23:19.160 --> 23:20.140
With my skills,

23:20.160 --> 23:21.790
I'll be able to pay back the money soon.

23:21.790 --> 23:22.720
And Xiu

23:22.720 --> 23:23.920
will grow up quickly.

23:25.830 --> 23:27.200
Do you really want Xiu to grow up?

23:27.200 --> 23:27.920
Of course.

23:29.160 --> 23:30.270
Don't you?

23:35.070 --> 23:35.880
Yuanzhong,

23:36.480 --> 23:37.680
after all the weapon spirits

23:37.680 --> 23:38.830
are unsealed,

23:39.030 --> 23:40.310
what do you plan to do?

23:41.640 --> 23:42.790
If you haven't thought about it,

23:42.790 --> 23:44.200
I've already come up with something for you.

23:46.070 --> 23:47.310
What do you have in mind?

23:48.590 --> 23:49.400
These are some excerpts from travel notes

23:49.400 --> 23:50.720
I transcribed from memory.

23:51.680 --> 23:52.480
Look.

23:52.920 --> 23:54.310
"I was to the east of Tanlu Pavilion,

23:54.310 --> 23:55.310
gazing at Chizhou,

23:55.440 --> 23:56.550
delighted by the sight.

23:56.790 --> 23:57.750
Crossing the Imperial River,

23:58.030 --> 23:59.000
treading the Wan Stream,

23:59.400 --> 24:00.350
traversing remote lands,

24:00.680 --> 24:01.880
and drinking a lot of sweet spring water,

24:02.110 --> 24:03.400
I reached the summit of the high mountain

24:03.440 --> 24:04.550
and the source of the river.

24:04.880 --> 24:05.960
Only then did I rest."

24:06.310 --> 24:07.510
What does this describe?

24:07.880 --> 24:09.680
This is about a poet

24:09.680 --> 24:11.720
who accidentally discovered the magnificent scenery of Chizhou.

24:11.790 --> 24:13.110
He crossed the Xiao River,

24:13.110 --> 24:14.350
climbed to the summit of Western Mountain,

24:14.350 --> 24:15.960
beheld the breathtaking landscape,

24:15.960 --> 24:17.400
experienced the charm of nature,

24:17.400 --> 24:18.750
and suddenly felt his heart open

24:18.750 --> 24:20.440
and his spirit become one with the world.

24:24.640 --> 24:25.590
What about this one?

24:26.160 --> 24:27.750
This is about a local custom.

24:27.750 --> 24:29.480
They have a tradition of drinking on ice beds.

24:29.750 --> 24:30.830
People feast joyfully,

24:31.270 --> 24:32.430
offering rare delicacies

24:32.510 --> 24:33.550
and countless fine wines,

24:33.550 --> 24:34.790
drinking heartily on ice beds,

24:34.790 --> 24:35.960
and singing loudly while admiring the snow.

24:38.270 --> 24:40.030
"Idly sitting among the pines,

24:40.440 --> 24:42.270
watching the snow collected from the pine branches melt in the pot."

24:42.400 --> 24:43.200
Exactly.

24:46.350 --> 24:47.550
This is a celestial phenomenon

24:47.550 --> 24:48.960
recorded in A Trip to Yongguan.

24:49.240 --> 24:50.030
It tells

24:50.350 --> 24:51.200
of a strange sight

24:51.200 --> 24:52.370
in the sky there—

24:52.480 --> 24:53.160
on a long night,

24:53.160 --> 24:54.680
a five-colored light appeared,

24:54.680 --> 24:56.640
shaped like a dragon or snake, illuminating the land,

24:56.640 --> 24:57.680
and it didn't disappear until half a month later.

24:57.750 --> 24:59.510
The sky there is colorful.

24:59.830 --> 25:01.220
A colorful sky?

25:01.240 --> 25:02.040
Yes.

25:02.130 --> 25:02.900
There are countless

25:02.930 --> 25:03.960
famous scenic spots and beautiful landscapes

25:03.960 --> 25:04.860
in this world.

25:04.960 --> 25:06.830
Each place has its own scenery and customs.

25:07.440 --> 25:08.240
Yuanzhong,

25:08.240 --> 25:09.480
after Xiu grows up

25:09.480 --> 25:10.680
and Ling Yao's seal is lifted,

25:10.680 --> 25:12.030
you should travel around

25:12.030 --> 25:13.310
and explore the world.

25:13.480 --> 25:15.750
You can see how flowers bloom,

25:16.070 --> 25:17.270
how the rain falls,

25:17.720 --> 25:19.510
see the ice beds of the far north,

25:19.550 --> 25:20.830
and the underground fire in the southern border.

25:20.850 --> 25:21.960
Just go wherever you want

25:22.110 --> 25:23.830
and live wherever you like.

25:23.960 --> 25:24.750
How does that sound?

25:28.830 --> 25:29.960
If I go traveling,

25:31.900 --> 25:32.690
what about you?

25:32.960 --> 25:34.960
Of course I'll go with you.

25:35.070 --> 25:36.200
If Zi Fei and the others are willing,

25:36.200 --> 25:37.920
they can come along too.

25:38.680 --> 25:39.480
Yuanzhong,

25:39.960 --> 25:42.030
this world is vast,

25:42.350 --> 25:43.680
far beyond the grudges between the Youhu Clan

25:43.680 --> 25:45.640
and the War Demons.

25:46.200 --> 25:47.880
Go and see it for yourself

25:48.440 --> 25:50.070
and live some lighthearted days.

26:14.840 --> 26:17.120
You can see how flowers bloom,

26:17.510 --> 26:18.720
how the rain falls,

26:19.120 --> 26:20.920
see the ice beds of the far north,

26:21.030 --> 26:22.240
and the underground fire in the southern border.

26:22.240 --> 26:23.550
Just go wherever you want

26:23.550 --> 26:25.200
and live wherever you like.

26:25.960 --> 26:26.750
Yuanzhong,

26:27.240 --> 26:29.350
this world is vast,

26:29.640 --> 26:31.000
far beyond the grudges between the Youhu Clan

26:31.000 --> 26:32.920
and the War Demons.

26:33.510 --> 26:35.160
Go and see it for yourself

26:35.640 --> 26:37.270
and live some lighthearted days.

27:03.830 --> 27:04.830
How could this happen?

27:31.590 --> 27:33.160
Deity Taihe's body

27:33.510 --> 27:35.270
may not last much longer.

27:35.400 --> 27:36.550
Once his divine body collapses

27:36.550 --> 27:37.750
and he has no other body to attach to,

27:37.920 --> 27:38.720
I'm afraid

27:39.060 --> 27:41.100
he'll soon vanish from this world.

27:59.440 --> 28:00.400
What rotten luck.

28:00.590 --> 28:02.160
We took on such a wretched task.

28:02.480 --> 28:03.530
Stop complaining.

28:03.640 --> 28:04.920
The construction in the city can't be completed.

28:04.920 --> 28:06.070
If we don't get them to do it, who will?

28:06.070 --> 28:07.110
Are you going to do it, or should I?

28:08.920 --> 28:09.830
Look at them.

28:10.240 --> 28:11.750
They're all beggars and vagrants.

28:12.000 --> 28:13.790
They're so hungry that they're almost fainting.

28:13.920 --> 28:15.090
How could they have the strength to work?

28:15.790 --> 28:17.400
We just need to gather enough people

28:17.400 --> 28:19.240
and hand over the required headcount.

28:19.510 --> 28:20.350
How many more do we need?

28:21.920 --> 28:22.720
One.

28:26.590 --> 28:27.640
Well, here's one right here.

28:28.400 --> 28:29.050
Stop.

28:29.200 --> 28:30.070
Where's your pass?

28:31.850 --> 28:33.680
You brat, playing dumb with me, huh?

28:37.720 --> 28:38.510
Waiter!

28:39.000 --> 28:39.640
Coming!

28:39.640 --> 28:40.270
Come.

28:40.790 --> 28:42.310
What should we do now?

28:42.640 --> 28:43.790
What should we do this time?

28:47.200 --> 28:48.590
Once we enter the city, we'll be doing hard labor.

28:48.640 --> 28:49.440
Bro,

28:49.830 --> 28:51.270
do you want to come up with a plan

28:51.270 --> 28:52.400
to leave here with us?

28:52.400 --> 28:53.400
Yes, bro.

28:53.400 --> 28:55.400
Once we enter the city, there will be nothing good waiting for us.

28:56.240 --> 28:57.030
Exactly.

28:58.830 --> 28:59.790
Let's hit the road.

29:00.030 --> 29:00.830
Let's go.

29:00.880 --> 29:01.680
Let's go.

29:01.790 --> 29:02.640
They ran away!

29:03.000 --> 29:03.790
Stop!

29:04.200 --> 29:05.310
Keep an eye on them!

29:06.270 --> 29:07.200
Get up! I said get up!

29:07.200 --> 29:08.030
Get up!

29:08.960 --> 29:11.760
[City Lord's Mansion]

29:15.680 --> 29:16.720
Young Mistress Dai.

29:22.640 --> 29:23.440
You're here.

29:24.350 --> 29:25.880
How are you feeling? Are you better now?

29:26.070 --> 29:26.920
Much better.

29:27.440 --> 29:28.680
The medicine from Dr. Zhang

29:28.680 --> 29:30.030
is really effective.

29:30.720 --> 29:32.310
Then I must thank him properly.

29:34.720 --> 29:35.510
Young Mistress.

29:36.240 --> 29:37.240
The medicine is ready.

29:37.270 --> 29:39.000
I still have things to do in the kitchen,

29:39.000 --> 29:40.430
so please feed him the medicine for me.

29:40.680 --> 29:41.480
-Okay.
-No need.

29:47.680 --> 29:49.640
Well... thank you.

30:23.550 --> 30:24.440
Have one of these.

30:25.270 --> 30:26.070
No need.

30:26.780 --> 30:28.540
Have one. The medicine is very bitter.

30:28.960 --> 30:30.070
You've never tried it.

30:30.480 --> 30:31.640
How do you know it's bitter?

30:32.830 --> 30:33.640
I...

30:35.630 --> 30:36.830
I just know.

30:42.240 --> 30:43.370
It's too sweet.

30:44.920 --> 30:46.230
Is it really that sweet?

30:48.510 --> 30:50.270
Eating sweet things like this every day,

30:50.640 --> 30:52.350
be careful your teeth might fall out when you get old.

30:53.110 --> 30:54.440
My teeth are fine.

30:54.460 --> 30:55.780
They won't fall out when I'm old.

30:57.160 --> 30:58.000
Really?

30:58.270 --> 30:59.640
I've been old before, remember?

31:07.720 --> 31:09.070
Always seeing you like this,

31:09.820 --> 31:11.010
I really have forgotten.

31:12.270 --> 31:13.400
What does it feel like

31:14.180 --> 31:15.250
to age?

31:18.110 --> 31:19.830
Actually, it's not that bad.

31:20.270 --> 31:21.150
It's just that...

31:21.270 --> 31:23.070
my energy was waning day by day;

31:23.880 --> 31:25.400
I couldn't run or jump high,

31:25.680 --> 31:27.640
and walking became slower and slower.

31:27.960 --> 31:29.400
At first, it was hard to accept,

31:29.510 --> 31:31.920
but gradually, I got used to it.

31:33.120 --> 31:34.680
Sometimes, I wonder,

31:35.160 --> 31:36.400
if in this world,

31:36.440 --> 31:38.000
there were no Youhu Clan,

31:38.750 --> 31:39.830
no immortal sects,

31:40.070 --> 31:41.310
no cultivators,

31:41.720 --> 31:42.920
and no gods,

31:43.270 --> 31:44.440
perhaps we humans

31:44.440 --> 31:45.480
would more easily

31:45.480 --> 31:46.960
accept aging.

31:47.510 --> 31:48.440
Perhaps.

31:49.160 --> 31:51.480
Comparisons breed discontent.

31:52.000 --> 31:53.720
All the suffering in this world

31:53.830 --> 31:55.310
comes from discontent.

31:56.000 --> 31:57.920
Even someone like my father

31:58.400 --> 32:00.070
can't see through the cycle of life and death.

32:01.550 --> 32:03.110
How much longer will it take for your father to exit seclusion?

32:04.160 --> 32:05.790
It should be some time.

32:07.750 --> 32:08.590
Don't worry.

32:08.680 --> 32:10.160
Shen Ying and your subordinates

32:10.160 --> 32:12.030
are still investigating Wushuang Society.

32:12.590 --> 32:13.720
I've already

32:13.720 --> 32:15.000
informed my brother about this.

32:15.240 --> 32:16.640
Yandu will never allow anyone

32:16.640 --> 32:18.160
to secretly communicate with the War Demons.

32:18.400 --> 32:19.110
We will definitely

32:19.110 --> 32:20.640
investigate this thoroughly

32:20.830 --> 32:21.900
and give you an explanation.

32:23.110 --> 32:23.920
Thank you.

32:25.030 --> 32:26.270
There's no need to thank me.

32:27.510 --> 32:29.640
The War Demons are also our enemies.

32:30.000 --> 32:31.270
Whoever came up with this plan

32:31.270 --> 32:32.790
of inciting stronger enemies to eliminate weaker ones

32:33.240 --> 32:34.750
is truly shortsighted.

32:36.110 --> 32:37.480
Inciting stronger enemies to eliminate weaker ones?

32:38.200 --> 32:39.720
You're really direct, aren't you?

32:40.480 --> 32:42.400
What do I have to hide from you?

32:43.070 --> 32:44.960
Although we humans have always been oppressed

32:44.960 --> 32:47.160
by the Youhu Clan,

32:47.720 --> 32:49.720
if the War Demons rise,

32:49.930 --> 32:51.680
they'll be after our lives.

32:51.820 --> 32:53.340
The weak always get beaten.

32:53.590 --> 32:55.110
What's the use of complaining?

32:55.920 --> 32:57.920
It's better to work hard to develop ourselves,

32:58.350 --> 32:59.240
and sooner or later, there will be a day

32:59.240 --> 33:00.880
when we can have an equal conversation.

33:04.480 --> 33:06.000
Let's not talk about this anymore.

33:08.240 --> 33:09.310
Is this for me?

33:11.240 --> 33:12.400
I was afraid you might get bored.

33:12.750 --> 33:13.790
What are these?

33:16.650 --> 33:17.570
How is it going?

33:17.840 --> 33:19.160
Shh, they're talking.

33:22.030 --> 33:23.160
This is a puzzle.

33:23.880 --> 33:25.000
When you're tired from reading,

33:25.000 --> 33:26.030
you can work on these.

33:26.120 --> 33:27.080
It's very simple.

33:28.300 --> 33:31.380
Are you sure this is simple?

33:32.470 --> 33:33.840
I used to do puzzles all the time when I was a kid.

33:33.860 --> 33:34.900
I can teach you.

33:50.110 --> 33:51.000
It's here.

33:52.070 --> 33:53.920
I was about to find it.

33:56.840 --> 33:58.230
♫Listening♫

33:58.250 --> 34:01.640
♫Toona leaves knock fireflies into a vase♫

34:01.660 --> 34:04.630
♫Ripples faintly spreading♫

34:05.310 --> 34:06.680
This is your puzzle.

34:05.510 --> 34:06.660
♫In the pavilion in the clouds♫

34:06.880 --> 34:08.770
♫Warm wine brews to the sound of the zither♫

34:06.960 --> 34:07.790
You've done it before,

34:08.150 --> 34:09.630
so it's easier for you to do it again.

34:09.030 --> 34:13.010
♫The fragrance lingers like brush strokes, sketching out your form♫

34:11.480 --> 34:13.400
This is a new one I had someone buy.

34:13.510 --> 34:14.510
My old puzzles from when I was a kid

34:13.980 --> 34:15.040
♫Tonight♫

34:14.510 --> 34:15.510
are many years old,

34:15.060 --> 34:19.060
♫In a light intoxication, I feel the longing in the crystalline snow♫

34:15.510 --> 34:16.670
and they're long gone.

34:19.199 --> 34:22.130
♫I cannot bear to think of you♫

34:22.719 --> 34:24.210
♫I only wish♫

34:24.239 --> 34:26.239
♫That the years would remain ever sunny♫

34:25.670 --> 34:26.760
You can't find it again?

34:26.630 --> 34:30.960
♫So that, within the drifting light, I could share the breeze with you♫

34:28.550 --> 34:29.400
It's here.

34:30.710 --> 34:31.920
I can find it.

34:31.230 --> 34:32.150
♫The wind blows♫

34:32.170 --> 34:34.020
♫It stirs the scenery♫

34:34.040 --> 34:35.489
♫It awakens our heart♫

34:35.520 --> 34:39.420
♫It makes me certain that you are my destiny♫

34:39.800 --> 34:41.060
♫The closer we get♫

34:41.090 --> 34:42.730
♫The more it feels like a dream♫

34:42.750 --> 34:44.150
♫And the more I look intoxicated♫

34:44.170 --> 34:48.020
♫I cannot fully express my yearning for you♫

34:48.190 --> 34:49.270
♫The wind blows♫

34:49.290 --> 34:51.290
♫It blows away the shadows of the clouds♫

34:51.310 --> 34:52.929
♫It makes the moon seem even brighter♫

34:52.949 --> 34:56.960
♫It makes me wake up from a dream♫

34:57.120 --> 34:58.340
♫The wind blows♫

34:58.360 --> 35:00.140
♫It reddens my eyes♫

35:00.200 --> 35:02.080
♫It warms the promise we made♫

35:02.230 --> 35:05.830
♫In the wind, we gently♫

35:05.850 --> 35:09.200
♫Drift into a better place♫

35:10.540 --> 35:11.430
♫The wind blows♫

35:11.450 --> 35:13.220
♫It stirs the scenery♫

35:11.670 --> 35:12.800
Not bad.

35:13.250 --> 35:14.830
♫It awakens our heart♫

35:13.420 --> 35:15.130
I'll take that as a compliment.

35:14.850 --> 35:18.580
♫It makes me certain that you are my destiny♫

35:15.150 --> 35:16.550
I am complimenting you.

35:18.980 --> 35:20.170
♫The closer we get♫

35:20.200 --> 35:21.810
♫The more it feels like a dream♫

35:20.320 --> 35:21.590
Hurry up and try again.

35:21.830 --> 35:23.330
♫And the more I look intoxicated♫

35:23.350 --> 35:27.670
♫I cannot fully express my yearning for you♫

35:25.070 --> 35:25.880
Here.

35:27.870 --> 35:29.090
♫The wind blows♫

35:29.110 --> 35:30.520
♫It blows away the shadows of the clouds♫

35:30.540 --> 35:32.160
♫It makes the moon seem even brighter♫

35:32.180 --> 35:36.440
♫It makes me wake up from a dream♫

35:36.460 --> 35:37.710
♫The wind blows♫

35:37.740 --> 35:39.260
♫It reddens my eyes♫

35:39.280 --> 35:41.280
♫It warms the promise we made♫

35:41.310 --> 35:45.140
♫In the wind, we gently♫

35:45.170 --> 35:48.930
♫Drift into a better place♫

35:54.660 --> 35:55.460
Young City Lord.

36:07.650 --> 36:09.450
They caused such a big mess?

36:10.000 --> 36:11.510
The scouts from Orange Lake reported that

36:11.630 --> 36:13.360
the High Priest of the Youhu Clan and his group

36:13.360 --> 36:14.510
have headed toward Su River.

36:14.710 --> 36:16.320
Our people have already been following them.

36:16.670 --> 36:18.070
Just follow them from a distance.

36:18.320 --> 36:19.880
They are not ordinary people.

36:19.900 --> 36:21.340
Don't draw their attention.

36:22.330 --> 36:23.440
Rest assured, Young City Lord.

36:25.840 --> 36:27.230
What is this High Priest

36:27.250 --> 36:28.930
really thinking?

36:29.220 --> 36:31.050
Since he has already broken the seal,

36:31.480 --> 36:32.230
why doesn't he

36:32.230 --> 36:33.670
take action against the Council of Elders?

36:34.560 --> 36:35.970
He once held a high position,

36:36.000 --> 36:37.350
with the strength of a demigod.

36:37.430 --> 36:39.270
After being imprisoned

36:39.290 --> 36:40.480
and enduring much torture,

36:40.680 --> 36:42.680
he has finally escaped.

36:43.080 --> 36:44.480
Yet, he's not seeking revenge on them.

36:45.280 --> 36:46.070
Could it be

36:46.510 --> 36:48.030
that he has really transcended human emotions,

36:48.110 --> 36:49.000
no longer harboring any feelings

36:49.000 --> 36:50.360
of love, hate, or resentment?

36:52.230 --> 36:53.070
Or perhaps...

36:54.320 --> 36:56.030
he doesn't hold a grudge against his own people

36:56.760 --> 36:59.470
and only wishes to deal with the War Demons?

37:00.840 --> 37:02.800
If that's the case, it could be troublesome.

37:05.760 --> 37:06.630
What about Shen Ying?

37:06.920 --> 37:08.320
Is he still with the Youhu people

37:08.320 --> 37:09.230
recently?

37:09.480 --> 37:10.280
Yes.

37:10.630 --> 37:12.030
They've been very close lately

37:12.320 --> 37:14.400
and are investigating Wushuang Society.

37:14.790 --> 37:16.390
Some clues are already very close.

37:16.480 --> 37:17.800
Our people are working to intervene.

37:17.840 --> 37:19.590
How is Mr. Tanghua's injury?

37:19.800 --> 37:20.760
It's getting better.

37:21.000 --> 37:22.070
What about him and Zhi Dai?

37:23.670 --> 37:25.190
I've had people keep an eye on them.

37:25.550 --> 37:26.360
The two of them

37:26.630 --> 37:27.760
are getting along very well.

37:31.260 --> 37:33.540
Getting along very well?

37:34.880 --> 37:35.670
Miss Ji.

37:38.630 --> 37:40.190
You overpaid me, Mr. Xu.

37:40.210 --> 37:41.210
My things

37:41.400 --> 37:42.680
aren't worth so much silver.

37:42.760 --> 37:44.070
And I still owe you money.

37:44.220 --> 37:45.280
I didn't overpay you.

37:45.320 --> 37:47.630
This is all you deserve.

37:49.070 --> 37:50.360
Well then, thank you very much.

37:52.840 --> 37:54.400
Is this a new treasure you got?

37:54.590 --> 37:56.000
I've never seen it before.

37:56.110 --> 37:57.710
You really have a great eye.

37:57.880 --> 37:59.990
This item is extraordinary.

38:03.190 --> 38:04.150
Watch closely, Miss.

38:04.150 --> 38:05.550
Its magic

38:05.630 --> 38:06.880
is yet to come.

38:20.860 --> 38:22.090
It's truly exquisite.

38:23.300 --> 38:25.260
It doesn't seem like magic.

38:28.400 --> 38:29.400
It's just ordinary clay,

38:29.400 --> 38:30.440
fired

38:30.440 --> 38:31.920
and coated with a layer of gold powder.

38:31.920 --> 38:33.280
There's nothing particularly special about it.

38:33.420 --> 38:35.420
This is the work of the great painter,

38:35.480 --> 38:37.800
Mr. Qi.

38:37.960 --> 38:39.030
Mr. Qi?

38:41.400 --> 38:42.190
Well,

38:42.760 --> 38:45.360
was the statue of the Goddess in the main hall of the dance house

38:45.510 --> 38:46.670
also painted by him?

38:47.440 --> 38:49.840
I really don't know.

38:56.280 --> 38:57.440
Take care, Miss Ji.

38:57.440 --> 38:58.400
Please come again another day.

39:02.800 --> 39:04.880
Truly a masterpiece.

39:06.670 --> 39:08.000
How was it made?

39:11.710 --> 39:13.400
Young City Lord, you're here.

39:13.400 --> 39:14.590
You seem so happy.

39:14.710 --> 39:16.440
What treasure did you get this time?

39:16.520 --> 39:18.290
I did indeed get a treasure,

39:18.360 --> 39:20.630
and I was about to present it to you, Young City Lord.

39:25.010 --> 39:26.170
-Thank you, sir.
-Thank you, sir.

39:26.200 --> 39:27.200
Take care.

39:32.000 --> 39:33.510
Who gave me this silver?

39:49.940 --> 39:51.060
How much is this?

39:51.840 --> 39:52.630
This...

39:53.960 --> 39:54.760
Xue?

39:56.280 --> 39:57.510
Long time no see.

39:57.960 --> 39:59.640
Tell me, what strange thing

39:59.670 --> 40:01.150
did you do to me while on the boat?

40:01.730 --> 40:03.250
W-what strange thing?

40:03.280 --> 40:04.200
I didn't do anything.

40:04.220 --> 40:05.010
Nonsense.

40:05.320 --> 40:06.710
I asked around after I came back.

40:07.000 --> 40:08.360
You said you were my neighbor,

40:08.440 --> 40:09.480
but why didn't any of the people I know

40:09.480 --> 40:10.500
recognize you?

40:10.530 --> 40:12.090
You must have used some kind of sorcery on me.

40:12.510 --> 40:13.180
Well...

40:15.230 --> 40:16.030
Really?

40:16.420 --> 40:17.650
Really.

40:18.000 --> 40:19.590
I had no other choice at the time.

40:19.590 --> 40:20.320
I had to find him

40:20.320 --> 40:21.230
right away.

40:21.230 --> 40:23.000
Otherwise, we all would have been in trouble.

40:23.480 --> 40:24.550
I know.

40:25.070 --> 40:26.070
After you all left,

40:26.510 --> 40:27.840
everyone said that the High Priest of the Youhu Clan

40:27.840 --> 40:28.840
saved us.

40:29.000 --> 40:30.110
And without you,

40:30.130 --> 40:31.610
I'm afraid I wouldn't have survived.

40:32.190 --> 40:33.880
But no matter if you're my childhood friend or not,

40:33.880 --> 40:35.710
you left without saying a word,

40:35.710 --> 40:36.800
and that really made me angry.

40:36.800 --> 40:38.840
I had to go after him at that time.

40:42.230 --> 40:43.030
Alright.

40:43.780 --> 40:45.010
I'll forgive you then.

40:46.110 --> 40:48.590
Well, you're not my neighbor anymore,

40:48.990 --> 40:50.280
but an immortal's handmaiden

40:50.710 --> 40:51.880
who can use magic.

40:51.880 --> 40:52.880
You're a big shot now.

40:52.900 --> 40:54.460
Do you still want to be my friend?

40:54.960 --> 40:55.960
Of course!

40:56.510 --> 40:57.360
I'm so happy

40:57.360 --> 40:58.400
to meet you again

40:58.420 --> 40:59.740
here in Yandu.

41:01.190 --> 41:02.760
Waiter! Waiter!

41:02.880 --> 41:03.920
Pack some date cakes for me.

41:03.920 --> 41:04.710
I'm taking them with me.

41:04.710 --> 41:05.440
Alright!

41:05.510 --> 41:06.320
Let me tell you,

41:06.320 --> 41:07.630
the date cakes here are delicious.

41:07.630 --> 41:08.590
Take some back

41:08.590 --> 41:09.880
for your High Priest to try.

41:09.880 --> 41:10.630
I'm sure he'll like them.

41:10.630 --> 41:11.440
Really?

41:11.710 --> 41:12.510
Try some.

41:15.390 --> 41:16.320
It tastes so good.

41:16.320 --> 41:16.840
Right?

41:16.840 --> 41:17.670
Make way! Make way!

41:18.840 --> 41:19.630
Hurry up!

41:20.070 --> 41:20.880
Hurry!

41:23.550 --> 41:24.230
Move!

41:24.230 --> 41:25.070
Make way! Make way!

41:27.280 --> 41:28.070
Hurry up!

41:30.880 --> 41:32.400
So you moved out?

41:33.630 --> 41:35.280
After I left the Shen family's tower ship,

41:35.530 --> 41:36.700
I got quite a bit of pay.

41:36.730 --> 41:38.450
When I came back, I rented a big courtyard

41:38.480 --> 41:39.590
and now I live alone.

41:39.760 --> 41:40.670
Let me tell you,

41:40.670 --> 41:41.760
my place is really big.

41:41.780 --> 41:43.260
It's not crowded no matter how many people live here.

41:43.360 --> 41:44.400
I'm thinking of

41:44.810 --> 41:46.040
subletting two rooms

41:46.070 --> 41:46.960
to make some extra money

41:46.960 --> 41:48.070
and also make the place a bit livelier.

41:49.800 --> 41:50.670
Make way! Make way!

41:51.510 --> 41:52.320
Hurry up!

41:52.880 --> 41:53.760
Hurry up, all of you!

41:54.550 --> 41:55.360
Move!

41:58.920 --> 42:00.150
Hurry up! Move it!

42:07.920 --> 42:09.320
What do they do?

42:09.510 --> 42:10.920
They're all laborers for the workshop.

42:11.000 --> 42:13.030
Many of them are vagrants who were caught here.

42:14.630 --> 42:16.110
Why is he here?

42:17.880 --> 42:19.430
Do you know anyone among them?

42:19.800 --> 42:20.880
You just said that

42:21.030 --> 42:21.880
as long as there's enough money,

42:21.880 --> 42:23.070
they can be ransomed?

42:32.320 --> 42:33.190
Come with me.

42:44.880 --> 42:45.670
Brat,

42:46.070 --> 42:47.550
were you the one who snitched earlier?

42:48.550 --> 42:49.990
Playing mute, huh?

42:50.400 --> 42:51.550
-Teach him a lesson!
-Yes!

42:52.870 --> 42:54.350
You try snitching again

42:54.370 --> 42:55.440
and see what happens!

42:55.470 --> 42:56.190
Stop.

42:59.440 --> 43:01.030
They're all here.

43:01.280 --> 43:02.280
Pick whoever you want.

43:07.110 --> 43:07.960
I want him.
